{'symbol': 'SRE', 'date': '2021-04-21 12:17:00', 'title': 'SOCALGAS TO PARTNER WITH SUNLINE TRANSIT AGENCY TO TEST INNOVATIVE TECHNOLOGIES THAT REDUCE COST OF HYDROGEN PRODUCTION', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES, APRIL 21, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0SOUTHERN CALIFORNIA GAS CO.\xa0(SOCALGAS) ANNOUNCED TODAY IT WILL DEMONSTRATE A GROUNDBREAKING TECHNOLOGICAL COMBINATION THAT WILL PRODUCE HYDROGEN FROM RENEWABLE NATURAL GAS (RNG) AT SUNLINE TRANSIT AGENCY\'S\xa0HYDROGEN FUELING STATION IN\xa0THOUSAND PALMS, CALIFORNIA.\xa0THE RESEARCH PROJECT, CALLED "H2 SILVERSTARS," WILL PRODUCE RENEWABLE HYDROGEN TO FUEL SUNLINE\'S FLEET OF 17 HYDROGEN FUEL CELL ELECTRIC BUSES AND SUPPORT FURTHER EXPANSION.'}